<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-950/70 text-emerald-300 text-[11px] font-medium border border-emerald-500/20">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span> Entregado
